      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm a grad student working on a sociology curriculum for a high school class. Can you help me put together a teaching guide that explains how systemic racism operates within the housing and banking industries? I want to make sure the students really understand the specific ways these systems maintain inequality.",
